# An unrecognised DCS string is consumed to its terminator and ignored (VT500).
# Only `DCS tmux;` is interpreted, and that is covered separately -- anything
# else must leave no trace, or a device-control payload would be typed onto the
# screen.
size: 16x3
description: an unrecognised DCS string leaves no trace

--- input
A\eP1;2|q[2Jpayload\stB

--- expect-grid
|AB|
||
||
